# Chat visual language

Apply these tokens when building the chat screen. Launch and auth screens use the near-black background and do not imitate chat bubbles.

- Background is near-black.
- Assistant bubbles are dark gray, rounded, and left aligned.
- User bubbles are a lighter gray pill, right aligned.
- The composer is a pill fixed to the bottom.
- Send is a circular white control on the right of the composer.
- The header carries the conversation title. The product name is Frontal.
- Guest chat keeps a Login control in the nav.
